4ZD49X","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-04-14/1081287266064_cb2d6ab85d9530d8a126_48.png","text":"何度か貼った気がするけどこういう関数をシェル側に仕込んでおくと便利です\n```function vim-startuptime-detail() {\n  local time_file\n  time_file=$(mktemp --suffix \"_vim_startuptime.txt\")\n  echo \"output: $time_file\"\n  time nvim --startuptime $time_file -c q\n  tail -n 1 $time_file | cut -d \" \" -f1 | tr -d \"\\n\" \u0026amp;\u0026amp; echo \" [ms]\\n\"\n  cat $time_file | sort -n -k 2 | tail -n 20\n}```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #random","ts":1618197644.438000,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C03C4RC9F/p1618197644438000","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C03C4RC9F/p1618197644438000"}],"edited":{"user":"B01HW2CERRU","ts":"1618200281.000000"},"subtype":"bot_message","bot_id":"B01HW2CERRU","username":"Reacji Channeler","icons":{},"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U01UHHEGGHE","text":"\u003c@U01UHHEGGHE\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618195158.010200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"UGH7VJE5N","text":"\u003c@UGH7VJE5N\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618164751.010000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
